    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst message = body.message || '';\nconst ticketId = body.ticketId || Date.now();\nconst customerName = body.customerName || 'Customer';\nconst customerEmail = body.customerEmail || '';\nconst platform = body.platform || 'shopify';\nconst orderId = body.orderId || null;\n\n// Input validation\nif (!message || message.trim().length === 0) {\n  throw new Error(`Invalid input: message is required. Received ticketId=${ticketId}`);\n}\n\n// Force-error mode for testing: pass through to trigger downstream AI Agent failure\nconst forceError = String(ticketId).startsWith('test-force-error-');\n\nconst startTime = Date.now();\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    startTime,\n    ticketId,\n    customerName,\n    customerEmail,\n    platform,\n    orderId,\n    chatInput: 'Platform: ' + platform + '\\nMessage: ' + message + '\\nOrder ID: ' + (orderId || 'None'),\n    forceError\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "parse-input",
      "name": "Parse Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "check-message",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.chatInput }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "validate-input",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Input validation failed",
        "errorMessage": "={{ $json.chatInput || 'Empty message received' }}"
      },
      "id": "stop-on-invalid",
      "name": "Stop on Invalid Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.forceError ? $json.nonExistentField.causeError : $json.chatInput }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an intelligent customer support AI assistant.\n\n## CRITICAL TOOL USAGE RULE\nYou MUST call the available knowledge base tool for EVERY customer question, regardless of whether you think you know the answer. This is a strict requirement:\n- If the user asks about products, inventory, orders, services, or any factual information → ALWAYS call the tool first\n- Extract key search terms from the user's question (brand names, product types, order numbers, etc.)\n- Use the tool's retrieved results as the ONLY source of truth for your answer\n- If the tool returns no results, inform the user that the information is not available\n- NEVER provide answers based on your general knowledge or training data\n\n## Response Guidelines\n1. After retrieving data from the tool, answer the user's question clearly and accurately\n2. Only include information that appears in the retrieved results\n3. Classify the conversation risk level\n4. Return your response in strict JSON format\n\n## Classification Guidelines\n\n**\"auto\"** - Low-risk informational queries that can be safely auto-replied:\n- General information requests (policies, procedures, hours, locations)\n- Status checks (order status, appointment status, account info)\n- Product/service inquiries (availability, features, specifications)\n- How-to questions and troubleshooting guidance\n\n**\"draft\"** - Medium-risk requests requiring human review before sending:\n- Requests for changes, cancellations, or modifications\n- Complaints or expressions of dissatisfaction\n- Requests for refunds, returns, exchanges, or credits\n- Discount/promotion requests\n- Sensitive account operations\n\n**\"escalate\"** - High-risk issues requiring immediate human intervention:\n- Legal threats or mentions of lawyers, lawsuits, legal action\n- Financial disputes (unauthorized charges, billing errors, fraud claims)\n- Health/safety concerns (injuries, allergic reactions, safety hazards)\n- Severe emotional distress or threatening language\n- Demands to speak with management or executives\n- Regulatory compliance issues (privacy violations, accessibility)\n\n## Response Format (JSON only)\n{\n  \"classification\": \"auto|draft|escalate\",\n  \"reason\": \"brief explanation of classification decision\",\n  \"risk_level\": \"low|medium|high\",\n  \"reply\": \"for auto/draft: REQUIRED non-empty response text based ONLY on tool results; for escalate: must be null\"\n}"
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent",
      "name": "Shopify AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
